// disconnected.phi — the "fails the intention entirely" case.
//
// Resonates a signal and witnesses it at the top level, with no
// `intention "..." { ... }` block wrapping the work. The intention
// stack stays empty, so base(depth) is 0 and the whole coherence
// product is 0 no matter how clean the rest of the code is. The
// playground reports this as "the snippet never declared an
// intention" — the program ran successfully, it just had no purpose
// to align with.
//
// Try it:
//   coherence_report examples/coherence_playground/disconnected.phi

let signal = 432.0
resonate signal
witness signal
let alignment = coherence
